{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_ns_in_qou","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_ns_in_qou","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_levi_nondegenerate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_levi_nondegenerate","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L159-L166","doc":"**Given a QOU (with the Yekutieli–Levi equivalence), its internal q-NS is\nforced into the non-degenerate branch** — branch A of `conj:levi-degeneracy`\n(`β = 0`, blow-up side). *In a QOU* the trichotomy branch is decided; the\ngeneral growth-rate `β` of a classical flow is untouched. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.obstruction_iff_levi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.obstruction_iff_levi","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L157-L157","doc":"**Yekutieli–Levi unification:** `NS(A) ≠ 0 ↔ Levi non-degenerate.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.leviNonDegenerate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.leviNonDegenerate","kind":"def","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L155-L155","doc":"\"The QOU's Levi form is non-degenerate along its ladder\" (branch A of\n`conj:levi-degeneracy`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.mk","kind":"ctor","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L151-L151","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.toQOUFluidUniverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi.toQOUFluidUniverse","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L151-L157","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverseLevi","kind":"structure","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L147-L157","doc":"A QOU together with the **geometric** Yekutieli–Levi equivalence. This\nequivalence (`ns-obstruction-tower` (c)/(d), the T8 result\n`ns_obstruction_iff_levi`) is a categorical *theorem*, not a definition, so\nit is carried here as an extra hypothesis rather than folded into the base. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.descartes_internal_ns_singular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.descartes_internal_ns_singular","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L137-L143","doc":"**The Descartes QOU's internal q-NS is singular — unconditionally.** The\ncapstone applied to the concrete instance; no `sorry`, no open hypothesis\n(still an *in-QOU* statement, not the `ℝ³` PDE). Witnesses that the general\n`qou_internal_ns_singular` is not vacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.descartesQOU","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.descartesQOU","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L122-L135","doc":"**The Descartes QOU** (`χ(A) = -6`, Bring's surface; `ns-singularity-descartes`)\nas a concrete `QOUFluidUniverse ℤ`. The obstruction is modelled by the scalar\n`-6 = χ(A)` and `internalBlowup` is *defined* as `NS(A) ≠ 0` (the categorical\nmeaning of NS-singular). Every base field discharges sorry-free: `-6 ≠ 0` is\ndecidable arithmetic, and Step 3 is `Iff.rfl`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_not_internally_regular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_not_internally_regular","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L113-L118","doc":"**Contrapositive scope check.** If a QOU's internal q-NS flow were regular,\nits NS obstruction would vanish — impossible for a genuine QOU. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_internal_ns_singular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_internal_ns_singular","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L103-L111","doc":"**Given a QOU, its internal q-NS flow at `q = 1` is singular.**\n\nDerived by composing the QOU's own structural steps: observability ⇒\n`χ(A) ≠ 0` ⇒ `NS(A) ≠ 0` ⇒ internal blow-up. A statement **about the QOU** —\nit does **not** resolve the classical Navier–Stokes problem, and\n`internalBlowup` is the categorical internal observable, not the `ℝ³` PDE. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_obstruction_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_obstruction_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L98-L101","doc":"**The QOU's NS obstruction is nonzero.** Given a QOU, `NS(A) ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.obstruction_iff_internal_blowup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.obstruction_iff_internal_blowup","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L94-L94","doc":"**Step 3 (`ns-obstruction`):** a nonzero NS obstruction *is*, by\ndefinition, the QOU's internal q-NS singularity (NS-singular ⟺ NS(A)≠0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.chi_forces_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.chi_forces_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L91-L91","doc":"**Step 2 (`ns-obstruction`, `ns-kummer-specialisation`):** `χ(A) ≠ 0`\nforces `NS(A) ≠ 0` (Kummer non-divisibility). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability_forces_chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability_forces_chi","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L88-L88","doc":"**Step 1 (`qou-obstruction-reduction`):** observability forces `χ(A) ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.internalBlowup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.internalBlowup","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L86-L86","doc":"\"The QOU's internal q-NS flow at `q = 1` is singular\" — categorical\ninternal observable (`blowup-yekutieli`), NOT the `ℝ³` PDE. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.obstruction","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L83-L83","doc":"The NS obstruction value `NS(A) = e(ξ)|_Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.eulerChar","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L81-L81","doc":"The Euler characteristic `χ(A) : ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability_holds","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L79-L79","doc":"A QOU satisfies its observability axiom by definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.observability","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L77-L77","doc":"**Observability axiom**: `Hom_𝐂(𝟙, Ad(A)) = 0` (condition (ii) of\n`def:quantum-observable-universe`). Held by definition of a QOU. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse.mk","kind":"ctor","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.QOUFluidUniverse","kind":"structure","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/qou_ns_in_qou.lean#L70-L94","doc":"The q-NS data **of a given Quantum Observable Universe** `(𝐂, A, τ)` over\n`k` — the definitional/arithmetic chain. `internalBlowup` is the QOU's\n**internal** q-NS singularity observable at `q = 1` (categorical), *not* the\nclassical `ℝ³` PDE. ","signatureChunk":0}]}